# Team Launch

**Only chief_of_staff may invoke teams.** L2 roles must not call `invoke_team`.

Launch team:

1. `fulcrum action exec list_team_templates` → available blueprints.
2. Select template matching work type (e.g., `code-review-team`, `feature-build-team`).
3. `fulcrum action exec invoke_team` with `template_id`, `workspace_id`, `project_id`, `task_id`, optional `overrides`.
4. Record returned `instance_id`. Monitor via `fulcrum action exec list_team_instances`.
5. `fulcrum action exec write_memory` documenting why team launched + responsibility.
